@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama CD 3: POST /api/v1/distributors (Creación / Importación de Centro)

actor "Planificador" as User
participant "App Web" as Web
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Distributor Service" as Service
participant "distributors DB" as DistDB

User -> Web: Selecciona centro en tabla SAP y pulsa "Importar"
Web -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/distributors\n{ name, cityId, latitude, longitude, codeSap }
Gateway -> Service: createDistributor(createDto, executorId)

Service -> Service: validatePayload(createDto)
Service -> DistDB: findByNameAndCity(name, cityId)
DistDB --> Service: existingRecord (o null)

alt Centro ya registrado previamente
    Service --> Gateway: 409 Conflict (Centro ya existe)
    Gateway --> Web: 409 Conflict
    Web --> User: Muestra notificación de centro duplicado
else Centro nuevo y válido
    Service -> DistDB: insertDistributor(createDto, executorId)
    DistDB --> Service: newDistributorRecord (id, name, lat, lng, cityId)

    Service -> Service: buildCreateDistributorResponse(newDistributorRecord)
    Service --> Gateway: createDistributorResponse
    Gateway --> Web: 201 Created (Datos del nuevo centro)
    Web --> User: Cierra modal, dibuja marcador de depósito y activa trazado de zona
end
@enduml
